how do you manage business and family  I'm gonna answer that question in  today's episode of luncheon urn so  recently got asked the question for one  of my Twitter followers love you guys  Imran who wrote in to say hi Evan is  there a family cost of being a  successful entrepreneur this is a  fantastic question and I think one that  every entrepreneur struggles with how  much time do I spend in my business how  much time I spend in my family and today  I'm gonna share three ways that I manage  my business and my family and hopefully  you can learn from it as well so number  one is step boundaries one of the most  important things I think that you can do  is figure out when you are going to work  and when you are gonna be with your  family and I think too many  entrepreneurs let that lead too much  there's no clear definition as to when  family time starts and when work time  starts one of the things that can  definitely help is start working when  your spouse starts working I find that  prior I used to wake up a little bit  later than my wife and I would start  working later than she would and I find  it it's easier to wake up at the same  time and while she's working I'm working  and then when she gets home I'm not  working anymore and having that clear  definition I think really helps recently  I've taken over a new business and I've  I've tried to juggle my time and had to  figure out okay now I've got a service  possibilities where can I make that fit  in my schedule and Nina was awesome and  suggested hey why don't we take some  time on Monday night and you can work on  this and I'll do some other stuff and  and I said no because I want to make  sure that the time that we're spending  together is together and not letting the  work bleed too much into our lives and  there's gonna be some days where you  have this emergencies where you can't  help it where something comes up when  you have to deal with it and hopefully  work on minimizing those emergencies I  like running a low emergency business  and no crisis business as much as  possible but basically planning around  this for that when you are working  you're working those are your work hours  you have a set schedule and when you  have your family time that's your family  time number two is involve them and this  is something that I grossly  underestimate the importance of earlier  in  my career I used to think that you know  running the business was my problem my  challenge and I didn't want that to  bleed into my personal life and not have  to make you know my my spouse and my  child worried about what I was doing but  the more that I've understood them the  more at least in my case I've realized  that they like to be involved they like  to know what's happened they like to be  at least understanding what's going on  in my business because it gives them  better contacts and so sometimes it can  help  so Nina's in a bunch of my videos  Hayden's in a bunch of my videos Nina  now helps comments respond to the  comments on the channel and that's all  fantastic and she gets an understanding  of why I'm doing this why it's so  important but even me just explaining  what's going on and not in the  frustrating way but talking about what's  happening in my day and why it's  important what I'm worried about that  makes it feel like we're on the same  team it makes it feel like SH in there  stands me more and it's not something  that I ever really needed so much I feel  personally just as a piece of  self-awareness that I don't really need  that validation where other people I  don't need other people to understand me  or comfort me for the most part but for  her it's important that she feels  connected to me in what I'm doing and so  I think if you can find ways to involve  your partner your family if it's just  them understanding what you're doing or  if there's a way that they can help in  some way that makes them feel a little  closer a little more connected to you I  feel like it really helps and my last  bit of advice is spend quality time  together I think you can definitely  increase the amount of time you spend  together but you want to make sure that  the time that you do spend together is  quality time I think too many people  might be with their significant other  but they're spending the time on their  phones and they're just watching a TV  show and they're not actually spending  quality time I'd much rather have an  hour of quality time with my wife where  we're talking or having dinner together  or dancing together and we feel some  kind of close connection then two hours  of just sitting watching a show or being  on opposite sides of a room checking our  phones I feel like that's not a real  connection so you want to make sure that  the limited amount of time that you have  in general right our time is limited and  everything that we do for your business  for your family for your hobbies for  your frame  your time is limited and you want to  make sure that every minute that you're  using counts for something and it's  helping you form a meaningful connection  and that is that's minutes that you'll  never get back and so make sure that the  time you're spending with your family is  quality time so those are my three  suggestions I'd love to know how you  balance your family and your business  leave a comment below maybe I could  learn something as well thank you so  much for watching you need to believe  and I'll see you soon
 

